2. The fix-it inserts `mut ` at 1:24, before the parameter's TYPE, giving `items: mut Vec[String]`, which does not parse. `karac fix` refuses: "applying 1 fix(es) would leave sortp_fix.kara with MORE parse errors than it started with -- refusing to write ... please report it". Inside a larger file (the app) it reports "skipped a fix at ...: applying it would not parse; please report it" and applies the others.

